# Accessibility

Target WCAG 2.2 AA per `standards/ACCESSIBILITY.md`.

- Localized accessible names via i18n keys, not hardcoded aria-labels.
- Focus order, contrast, and touch targets for mobile.
- Do not rely on color alone for critical state.
- Automated a11y lint gates activate when UI framework is chosen (currently PLANNED).
